  "prefLabel": "Ed 322.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 322.01 Purpose. The purpose of Ed 322 is to implement the provisions of RSA 198:15-hh relative to providing annual grants to meet the costs of leasing permanent space in buildings for regional career and technical education centers that are used for the operation of high school career and technical education programs.\n\nSource. #8086, eff 5-26-04; ss by #10363, eff 6-15-13; ss by #13207, eff 5-20-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ed300.html"
